cargoboard-php
PHP client for the Cargoboard REST API

Copyright 2026 Very Code
Homepage: https://very-code.com
Repository: https://github.com/very-code-com/cargoboard-php

This product provides an open-source PHP client for the Cargoboard API, covering
quotations, bookings (direct and quotation-based), order cancellation, shipment
label and confirmation PDFs, track & trace, invoices and ADR/dangerous-goods
master data, for groupage, LTL, FTL, loading-metre and parcel shipments.

